WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:45.020
Harry is probably the son of the last King, Machaty.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.620
If we assume it's true...

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.910
that makes Kajika and His Highness Rumaty cousins.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:56.170
Dragging the matter back up again now...

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:00.150
would benefit neither Burnsworth nor the Kingdom of Raginei.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.440
Why did Harry introduce the two of them?

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.550
I'm home!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:10.720
Welcome back.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:13.530
Did you find your father well in the Middle East?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.790
Yes, thank you.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:18.850
I've been told to dedicate myself to my work!

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:22.000
Toranosuke Haga, back on duty as of now!

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.300
Where's Miss Kajika?

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.010
Out with Noei.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.540
Just because I took a day off?!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.890
You're going to fire me and hire Noei?!

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:38.570
He is merely a substitute.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:43.400
His skills are top-notch, but being fresh from the military...

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.510
...poses some problems.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:50.730
"Alone"

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.690
--Hey, wanna go in?
--Uh-huh!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.960
Let's stop for today...

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:07.430
Y--yeah...

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.580
Isaac!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.960
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:14.150
You ought to come in with me.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.270
I stick out.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:18.610
I'd only be a bother in a store.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.460
This is your first time meeting Mustafa, right?

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:27.080
Mustafa was the name of the leopard you loved, was it not?

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.700
His spirit entered into a human, Eugene De Volkan.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:34.660
That's why I call him Mustafa.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.650
<i>Puttin' the moves on someone else's woman--</i>

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.490
<i>Dammit, I ain't scared!</i>

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:44.180
I came home to find her here of her own free will.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:47.210
If you're her boyfriend, you ought to keep an eye on her.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:50.940
What!? Dammit...

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:54.090
Damn you and your bitching!

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.420
I'd like to slice up that pretty face!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.080
St--stop!

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.380
Go ahead, if you want.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.330
I'm not that fond of this face.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.940
Come on, then.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.650
You little--

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:12.120
I'll teach you to make fun of people!

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:25.900
Is it over?

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.180
Come on in. It's safe now.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.110
Kajika!

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:34.190
Mustafa, you're still getting in hot water!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.060
This time it's not my fault.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.340
Who-- who is this kid?

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.840
Me? I'm--

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.420
--my master.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.300
I'm her...

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.950
pet.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.830
Absolutely not. He deserves whatever he gets.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.430
Mustafa was kicked out, he has nowhere to stay!

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.630
Let him stay until he finds something!

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.230
<i>What idiot would bring the wolf and the lamb together?</i>

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.560
C'mon, c'mon, please...

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.020
Say yes!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.730
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon, dangit!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.070
Do you...

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:21.310
always scowl like that?

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.820
So you were an officer in Raginei's Royal Guard?

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.840
I'm Kajika's bodyguard now.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.790
You just replaced your master and started over, huh.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.610
That made you angry, right?

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.940
You looked like you wanted to hit me.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:42.470
I have better things to do...

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:45.800
than hit my employer's masochistic pet.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.860
Masochistic?

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.170
Mustafa!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.400
Lee-Leng says you can stay for a while!

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.660
It's been a long time, Eugene.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.810
It must be two months since we met in Japan.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.940
I hear I've received permission to stay...

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.930
I'm happy to be of service.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.090
Thanks so much.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:15.680
<i>As if this is even your house, you old sourpuss trapped in a young man's body.</i>

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.940
A friend in need...

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:23.200
<i>You're nothing but trouble, you drain-on-society piece of dead weight.</i>

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:28.030
They've really upped the hate level, haven't they?

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.510
Think so?

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.200
Ah, I'll get it!

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.830
Hello?

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.120
Rumaty!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.230
Rumaty!

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.900
Kajika!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.120
You look good.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.470
Cruel boy!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.560
Didn't you know I had no way to get in touch with you?

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.370
I've never seen you dressed up like that!

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:06.550
There was a ceremony in Britain for my father's old teacher.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:10.060
My father is ill, so I went instead.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.670
Your father is ill?

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.160
Don't worry, it's nothing serious.

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:19.140
Kajika, would you mind letting me stay here for the week?

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.720
Can you stay!? At my house!?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.190
Yeah.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.700
Welcome, Your Highness.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.750
Lee-Leng Huang...

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.680
it's been a long time.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.380
This is Eugene De Volkan. He's a friend of Kajika's.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.520
It's an honor to meet you, Your Highness.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:53.030
If that's the kind of aide you keep around, you have good taste.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.770
He's not my aide; he's my friend.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.380
Noei...

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.990
Since everything happened...

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.450
he's been acting as my bodyguard.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.440
Just today he came to Eugene's rescue.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.180
I'm glad he can be of use to you.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.040
I hear you'll be with us for a week.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:25.070
I have some business which obliges me to return immediately to my country.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.850
Sezun will be looking after His Highness.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.150
I see. Well, at any rate, please come in.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.610
2nd Lt. Noei!

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:44.870
Sezun!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:49.410
While I am gone, you will be First Chamberlain to His Highness.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:51.330
Do not leave his side for an instant.

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:52.980
Y--yes, sir.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.800
Noei. How does it feel, being kept by Burnsworth?

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:05.180
It doesn't mean I've sold my heart.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.870
As long as I draw breath, I will wait for my chance to serve His Highness...

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:13.590
I have a message from His Highness, the Crown Prince Somand.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.750
From His Highness Somand?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.780
"I'm sorry for what I've done to you.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.060
Someday I will call you home.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:26.360
When the time comes, let nothing stand in the way of your return."

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:28.230
Truly?

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.310
The Prince said that?

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.460
That's great...

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:34.800
you and your brother are on good terms now...

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.870
It's all thanks to Quinza.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.500
I see...

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.910
Apart from that, though, if my father's illness is prolonged...

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:45.090
it may be that my brother will take the throne.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.710
So what's wrong?

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.170
When that happens...

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.400
I can never see my father's face again.

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.560
It feels a little sad.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:54.990
But--why?

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.360
When you give up the throne, you are called the Throne of God...

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.540
and you can no longer see anyone but the priests.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.950
Huh? That sounds awful...

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.800
That's just how it is. Even my grandfather Machaty did it.

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:12.170
Are you saying you've never even seen your grandfather's face?

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.870
I have, but I've forgotten it.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.170
I haven't seen him since I was seven.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.340
He's still alive, though...

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.520
The old folks tell me I look just like him.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.510
Excuse me for interrupting your discussion.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.740
You're going?

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.500
Leaving already?

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:35.990
Miss Kajika, please take care of His Highness.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.890
Leave it to me.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:42.490
Well, Your Highness, pardon me for going ahead of you.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.210
Your Highness...

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:53.260
never doubt your servant Quinza.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.250
You must not do anything rash.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:01.060
Until I come for Your Highness, do not stir from this place.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.420
Quinza...

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:09.280
There is nothing for Your Highness to worry about. Leave everything to me.

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:13.770
The lifelong loyalty of your servant Quinza is yours alone!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.880
And now, I must say farewell for a little while.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.220
Quinza...

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.810
I have to stop him!

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.220
Somehow I just know...

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.960
I can't let him leave!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.390
Wait, Quinza!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.450
Quinza...

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.010
<i>What is this uneasiness?</i>

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:24.980
Okay...

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.170
It worried me...

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:32.680
It's only a week, but he spoke as if he'd never see me again.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:36.880
Maybe I'm just nervous...

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:42.140
but it's because I've never been away from Quinza for this long before.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:48.000
Really? You and Quinza have been together all this time?

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.430
Since I was three years old...

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.710
we've been together constantly.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.550
Then you can't help feeling lonely now.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.080
You really think so?

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.560
Besides, you can tell just by looking...

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:03.160
You're truly important to Quinza.

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:05.650
Kajika...

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:10.380
Do you remember our talk about studying abroad?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:11.940
Of course!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.910
I think the only freedom I'll have in my whole life...

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.470
will be for those four years.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:23.130
That's why... whatever happens, I want to spend them with you.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.050
If I can do that...

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:28.510
then I'll give the rest of my life to Raginei.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.610
Rumaty...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.660
We'll go together.

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:40.600
I promise.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.050
Good morning, Your Highness!

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:57.030
I am shocked!

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.540
You "had a long talk and fell asleep?"

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.950
How old are you, Kajika?!

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.330
Fourteen.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.330
What does being fourteen mean?

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.810
It means taking responsibility.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:10.690
In other words, you're an adult!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.650
Now, now, Master Lee-Leng...

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.270
E--excuse us...

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.070
Your Highness...

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:23.930
I hear you're scolding Kajika. Is it true?

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.410
As you see.

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.400
We are friends!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.160
What's wrong with sleeping together?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.440
You and Kajika are both adults now.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.840
You can't get by with that logic at your age.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.480
Do you mean Kajika won't be able to marry?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:44.170
I'm saying it would be better if there wasn't any gossip floating around.

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.070
Then I'll do it the proper way!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.170
Proper?

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.870
I will make Kajika my princess!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:56.020
Princess...

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.270
Y--your Highness! Don't joke about that kind of thing...

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:01.140
I'm serious!

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:02.810
Let's go, Kajika!

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.640
Y--your Highness! If you would please wait...

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.460
I'm so sorry...

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:17.140
On top of not knowing the ways of the world, His Highness can be very single-minded...

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:20.130
I know.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:25.100
Divine Providence is with His Highness, right?

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.680
It was probably like that even in the Royal Palace...

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.070
But he isn't hated.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.260
Right...

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:43.400
He makes you want to do something for him, to help him...

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:48.900
This irrational appeal... it's an essential quality in a leader.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.920
In a word, charisma.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:58.650
His Highness Rumaty possesses innately the foremost qualities required of a leader.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:05.750
That's what makes Crown Prince Somand so uncomfortable.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.160
But that...

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.010
His Highness Rumaty would never...

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.330
Please excuse me...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:24.480
He's Quinza's younger brother, right?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:26.650
Right. Why do you ask?

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:30.050
Well, they're completely different, from their faces to their personalities.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:34.640
If I had an older brother like that, I'd get a complex...

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.990
He has his own virtues...

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.680
sides of him that are very good indeed...

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.910
I see...

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:47.540
What's more, don't be fooled by Quinza's appearance.

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:52.960
He's definitely a sharp one. Too sharp.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.190
But there's something about him...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.280
I sense something lacking in him as a person...

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.780
I hope I'm making too much of it, but...

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.430
Lt. Noei!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:17.520
Is it true, Their Highnesses Somand and Rumaty have reconciled?

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:19.410
It's true...

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:22.800
My brother forced an audience with His Highness Somand...

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:26.500
and won him over in a single visit.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.490
In a single visit?

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:29.910
Yes...

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:34.530
Since then, His Highness Somand has called my brother to his palace several times.

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:37.430
Sometimes, His Highness Rumaty goes with him.

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:40.240
I see... I'm relieved.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.750
From now on the Kingdom of Raginei will be at peace.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.220
What's wrong?

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:50.450
To tell the truth...

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:53.350
I'm scared of my brother.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.100
When His Highness Somand hated His Highness Rumaty so much...

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.320
to reconcile them in just one day...

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.580
What method could he possibly have used?

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.350
What my brother is thinking...

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.160
to me, it's...

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.190
If that's what you feel...

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:20.310
stand firm.

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:25.490
What they need in the Palace right now are good, honest people like you!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.100
So I ask you...

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:34.370
protect the Kingdom of Raginei from within!

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:37.150
I will! Lieutenant!

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:46.420
You took me by surprise, doing that so suddenly...

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:49.830
I'm serious. You don't want to?

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:53.570
Well, I do like you, too.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.560
Then there's no problem!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:57.880
When it comes to marriage...

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.890
I have some... special circumstances...

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:01.290
Circumstances?

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.610
A husband-hunting game?

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.290
And... how many have you found?

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:20.000
I think the first one was Mustafa.  After that, though...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.640
Well, then I'm the second!

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:27.420
I'm sure I'm one of the men your father chose!

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:30.510
You may say you're sure, but...

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.340
There's no way I'm not one of them!

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.830
I like that side of you...

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.550
I'm sure you remember...

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:44.390
Followers of Ragi do not remove their cloths in public.

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:48.110
They are only removed when admitting defeat to an adversary... and...

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:54.620
when making a proposal to a member of the opposite sex!

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.480
Kajika...

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.890
I've just proposed to you!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:04.180
Whoever those three men may be, you will choose me!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:07.330
As long as I live, I'll have no other princess!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.380
Do you... dislike me?

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.070
No, not at all. But...

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:21.790
But?

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.100
I don't really understand it all yet...

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.050
I know I like you...

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.790
but I don't think it's love...

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:32.340
You feel the same way, right?

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:34.500
Y--yeah...

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.920
if you don't feel like that, I guess it's wrong to get married...

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:40.490
I think that's how it works... usually...

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.760
However, we may feel like that someday...

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:47.380
If that happens, let's get married.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:49.470
Okay, sure!

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.960
Alright! Let's wait until then!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.750
I'll try to start feeling that way soon!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.160
<i>It's the strangest thing...</i>

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:03.040
<i>Me, taking an interest in people...</i>

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.500
<i>There are just too many interesting ones around Kajika...</i>

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:15.240
<i>For certain, if Burnsworth is thinking of Kajika...</i>

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:18.210
<i>he should cut all ties with Raginei.</i>

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:23.700
Excuse me!

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:25.460
What's happened?

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.830
This is still top secret, but...

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.400
Too late!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.660
Dammit, Quinza...

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:40.280
I'm sure you knew this was going to happen!

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:43.480
As of now, whether he likes it or not...

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:46.080
Burnsworth has been dragged into Raginei's coup!

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.650
Lee-Leng, what's wrong?

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.270
What did you need to talk to us about?

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:02.170
Your Highness, please listen and try to stay calm...

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:04.730
What?

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.410
Has something happened?

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.080
His Majesty, the King, has--

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:10.890
your father...

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.110
has passed away.

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:16.120
But what... so suddenly...

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:18.270
It can't be...

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.480
That's impossible!

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:26.000
It can't...

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:29.270
Contact Quinza! I'm going home immediately!

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:32.310
You can't go home.

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:36.890
You have been exiled for treason.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:39.790
Your Highness...

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.020
if you insist on returning, you will likely be imprisoned.

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:51.320
Fool...

00:22:55.870 --> 00:23:00.430
That... that's not true!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
